WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.574
Follow the three linked boxes Sending invitations is an

00:00:04.626 --> 00:00:09.653
activity A ready decision pack is an output The

00:00:09.666 --> 00:00:13.561
intended outcome is a decision based on reliable information

00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:19.380
The input-owner cards make responsibility visible An agreed deadline

00:00:19.432 --> 00:00:22.314
and a controlled document reference are more useful than

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.551
assuming that somebody will send the paper

00:00:25.393 --> 00:00:28.038
At the review point check the pack against the

00:00:28.077 --> 00:00:32.538
agreed requirements A missing approval or paper remains an

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.077
open gap Do not describe the pack as ready

00:00:36.143 --> 00:00:37.853
because invitations were sent
